      "content": "The Openlayer REST API for AI evaluation, testing, and observability. Manage projects, commit model versions and datasets, run and evaluate tests, create inference pipelines for production monitoring, and stream production inference data into Openlayer. All requests are authenticated with a Bearer API key.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Openlayer Support\n Email: support@openlayer.com",
